  "_comment": "Example CLIENT config with the spec's default 5 channels x 4 bots = 20 links. JSON has no native comments; this _comment field is ignored by vtel's config parser (unmatched JSON fields are silently ignored) and exists purely for documentation. Most real deployments will want far fewer links - a small handful is already a meaningful independent backup channel; 20 is shown here only to match the scale this format was designed for. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_* placeholder before use: token = this bot's BotFather token, peer_bot_id = the paired server-side bot's numeric user ID (from getMe), channel_id = the shared private channel's chat ID (both bots must be admins of it). See README.md's Setup section for the exact steps.",
